  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The burden of the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the land of Hadrach, and Damascus",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the rest thereof: when the eyes of man, as of all the tribes of Israel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toward the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Hamath also shall border thereby; Tyrus, and Zidon, though it be very wise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Tyrus did build herself a strong hold, and heaped up silver as the dust, and fine gold as the mire of the streets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, the Lord will cast her out, and he will smite her power in the sea; and she shall be devoured with fire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashkelon shall see",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and fear; Gaza also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall see it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and be very sorrowful, and Ekron; for her expectation shall be ashamed; and the king shall perish from Gaza, and Ashkelon shall not be inhabited.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And a bastard shall dwell in Ashdod, and I will cut off the pride of the Philistines.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will take away his blood out of his mouth, and his abominations from between his teeth: but he that remaineth, even he,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for our God, and he shall be as a governor in Judah, and Ekron as a Jebusite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will encamp about mine house because of the army, because of him that passeth by, and because of him that returneth: and no oppressor shall pass through them any more: for now have I seen with mine eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Rejoice greatly, O daughter of Zion; shout, O daughter of Jerusalem: behold, thy King cometh unto thee: he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "just, and having salvation; lowly, and riding upon an ass, and upon a colt the foal of an ass.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will cut off the chariot from Ephraim, and the horse from Jerusalem, and the battle bow shall be cut off: and he shall speak peace unto the heathen: and his dominion",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from sea",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to sea, and from the river",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the ends of the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for thee also, by the blood of thy covenant I have sent forth thy prisoners out of the pit wherein",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no water.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Turn you to the strong hold, ye prisoners of hope: even to day do I declare",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will render double unto thee;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I have bent Judah for me, filled the bow with Ephraim, and raised up thy sons, O Zion, against thy sons, O Greece, and made thee as the sword of a mighty man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be seen over them, and his arrow shall go forth as the lightning: and the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall blow the trumpet, and shall go with whirlwinds of the south.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts shall defend them; and they shall devour, and subdue with sling stones; and they shall drink,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "make a noise as through wine; and they shall be filled like bowls,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the corners of the altar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God shall save them in that day as the flock of his people: for they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.9.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
